# Cloud rooms (PR #12). Leave these blank to run the app in local-only mode
# (IndexedDB + PeerJS best-effort), which is exactly the current behaviour.
#
# Fill them in with your Supabase project's values to enable persistent,
# shareable multi-user rooms. Only the PUBLISHABLE (anon) key belongs here —
# never put the service-role key in the frontend or commit real keys.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
